1
00:00:06,707 --> 00:00:07,727
(Sheldon:)Here you go.

2
00:00:07,975 --> 00:00:10,735
- Great. Come on in.
- What, you don't say thank you?

3
00:00:11,512 --> 00:00:14,572
(Howard:)It's my suitcase.
I lent it to you two years ago.

4
00:00:15,116 --> 00:00:17,546
(Raj:)I should tell you
I broke the wheel and the handle.

5
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:24,182
(Raj:)So is everyone from Bernadette's company
going to Vegas?

6
00:00:24,392 --> 00:00:27,092
(Howard:)No, just me, her,
and a couple of the bigwigs.

7
00:00:27,261 --> 00:00:29,021
(Howard:)It's part of a bonus she got.

8
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:31,360
(Raj:)Cool. Did she discover a cure
for something?

9
00:00:31,566 --> 00:00:35,596
(Howard:)Not exactly. They spent a ton of money
developing this dandruff medication...

10
00:00:35,803 --> 00:00:39,363
(Howard:)...that had the side effect
of horrible anal leakage.

11
00:00:41,576 --> 00:00:43,806
(Raj:)Is there a good anal leakage?

12
00:00:46,647 --> 00:00:51,087
(Howard:)Anyway, it was Bernie's idea to rebrand
the stuff as a cure for constipation.

13
00:00:51,652 --> 00:00:56,642
(Raj:)Way to make lemonade, you know, from
around the corner where fudge is made.

14
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:02,730
- Hey, I got a favor to ask.
- Sure.

